@startuml CryptoWeb-07-uc07-run-backtest
title CryptoWeb - UC07 - Run Historical Strategy Backtest

!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam activityFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 45

|Verified User|
start
:Select symbol, interval and date range;
:Set MA windows and initial capital;
:Request historical backtest;
|Backtesting Service|
:Authenticate and validate strategy settings;
if (Valid interval, dates and parameters?) then (no)
  |Verified User|
  :View parameter error;
  stop
endif
:Fetch historical OHLCV candles from Binance;
if (Sufficient history?) then (no)
  |Verified User|
  :View insufficient/unavailable data error;
  stop
endif
|Backtesting Service|
:Generate moving-average crossover signals;
:Simulate hypothetical trades and equity curve;
:Calculate returns, drawdown and trade metrics;
:Store backtest result in MongoDB;
|Verified User|
:Review strategy metrics and simulation;
stop
@enduml
